      "output": "All seven files are handed on unchanged: each publish receipt's SHA-256 equals the one computed from the input, and `cmp` found every copy identical to its input.\n\n| File | Bytes | What it is | Measures | SHA-256 (first 12) | Same bytes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| wren.glb | 1,523,040 | Rigged student, binary glTF 2.0 | 23 bones in 1 skin; 1 mesh, 13,350 triangles (17,288 vertices); 1 material with 3 embedded WebP textures (colour, normal, ORM); 4 clips: idle 15.3667 s, run 1.2667 s, sit 7.2 s, walk 2.3667 s | `23bf507cee8f` | same bytes: yes |\n| wren-extra.glb | 1,101,340 | Further clips for the same skeleton, binary glTF 2.0 | Same 23 bones; same mesh counts (13,350 triangles); 3 placeholder textures of 76, 246 and 252 bytes; 2 clips: cast_a_spell 5.4 s, jump 2.2333 s | `6f656ac0db04` | same bytes: yes |\n| gold.jpg | 778,488 | Painted sky, gold hour | 4096 × 1738 px, RGB JPEG, no alpha | `1f99fcbca143` | same bytes: yes |\n| blue.jpg | 559,248 | Painted sky, blue hour | 4096 × 1738 px, RGB JPEG, no alpha | `45b57673e245` | same bytes: yes |\n| moon.jpg | 12,790 | The moon | 256 × 256 px, RGB JPEG, no alpha | `8c2aec63190a` | same bytes: yes |\n| crow.webp | 9,812 | Cut-out card | 256 × 256 px, RGBA, has alpha (75.8% fully transparent, 18.0% fully opaque) | `4b86bcb877ba` | same bytes: yes |\n| fir.webp | 35,262 | Cut-out card | 256 × 512 px, RGBA, has alpha (55.3% fully transparent, 36.7% fully opaque) | `77d7cbed744e` | same bytes: yes |\n\nTotal 4,019,980 bytes.\n\n**Bones (23):** Root, Hips, Spine, Spine1, Spine2, Neck, Head; Shoulder, Arm, ForeArm and Hand on each side; UpLeg, Leg, Foot and ToeBase on each side. In the file, every bone except Root carries a rig prefix ending in a colon before these names. Every clip has 69 channels.\n\n**What the three pictures show (viewed once each):**\n- gold.jpg: a low sun just right of centre, near the bottom, under broken grey clouds lit orange from below, with a pale haze band along the lower edge.\n- blue.jpg: a dusk sky of dark blue-violet clouds over a teal opening with a few faint stars, an orange strip of afterglow on the horizon and blue mist across the lower quarter.\n- moon.jpg: a full, warm-white moon with grey maria, filling the frame on a black background.\n\n**For the builders:**\n- **Extension required:** both models list `EXT_texture_webp` as required, so the loader must support it.\n- **wren-extra.glb is a clip carrier:** it repeats the whole mesh, but its textures are placeholders. Take only its two clips and draw Wren from wren.glb.\n- **Clips:** the six are idle, run, sit, walk, cast_a_spell and jump. There is one cast clip for the two spells, and none is named for flying or the broom. The idle clip is far longer than the others, at 15.37 s.\n- **Skies:** at 4096 × 1738 they are not 2:1, so they are not full equirectangular panoramas.\n- **Moon:** it has no alpha, so its black square will show unless it is blended or masked.\n- **Size:** wren.glb is the largest file, at 1.52 MB, under the 2 MiB limit.\n- **Not checked:** the two cards were measured but not looked at, and no file was opened in a renderer.",
